    "rich_text_QXRhTU": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_dz7hqA": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Gemstone Origin: Why It Matters",
            "use_h1": false
          }
        },
        "text_b3PXbJ": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The origin of a gemstone can influence its desirability and value.</p><p>For example:</p><ul><li>Sapphires from Kashmir or Sri Lanka<br/></li><li>Emeralds from Colombia<br/></li><li>Rubies from Myanmar<br/></li></ul><p>While origin can impact pricing, overall quality characteristics remain the most important factor.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        },
        "subheading_9KCBcw": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Natural vs Treated Gemstones"
          }
        },
        "text_fnkpfy": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Most gemstones undergo treatments to enhance their appearance.</p><h3>Natural Gemstones</h3><p>Untreated or minimally treated stones with natural color and clarity.</p><h3>Treated Gemstones</h3><p>Common treatments include:</p><ul><li><br/>Heat treatment (to enhance color)<br/></li><li><br/>Oil or resin filling (for clarity improvement)<br/></li><li><br/>Surface treatments<br/></li></ul><p>These treatments are widely accepted but should always be disclosed.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        },
        "subheading_nkieYx": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Durability and Everyday Wear"
          }
        },
        "text_6AX3Cj": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Different gemstones vary in hardness and durability.</p><ul><li><strong>Hard gemstones</strong> (sapphire, ruby): Suitable for daily wear<br/></li><li><strong>Softer gemstones</strong> (opal, turquoise): Require more care<br/></li></ul><p>Durability is especially important when choosing gemstones for rings or everyday jewelry.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_dz7hqA",
        "text_b3PXbJ",
        "subheading_9KCBcw",
