    "rich_text_bX84gd": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_HKpFN4": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Choosing the Right Gemstone",
            "use_h1": false
          }
        },
        "text_jMDRxP": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Selecting a gemstone depends on personal style and intended use.</p><p>Consider:</p><ul><li>Color preference<br/></li><li>Occasion (everyday vs occasional wear)<br/></li><li>Budget<br/></li><li>Symbolism (birthstones, meaning, etc.)<br/></li></ul><p>For example:</p><ul><li>Sapphires for durability and classic appeal<br/></li><li>Emeralds for rich color and uniqueness<br/></li><li>Amethyst or citrine for accessible luxury</li></ul>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        },
        "subheading_FCCXH9": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Buying Gemstones Online"
          }
        },
        "text_MFmzFx": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>When purchasing gemstones online, transparency is key.</p><p>Look for:</p><ul><li>Clear product specifications<br/></li><li>Disclosure of treatments<br/></li><li>High-quality images or videos<br/></li><li>Certification (where applicable)<br/></li><li>Return policies and warranty<br/></li></ul><p>At Milano Jewelry, we ensure every gemstone is clearly described and carefully set, offering both quality assurance and customer support.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        },
        "subheading_7m7M9f": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Care and Maintenance"
          }
        },
        "text_jDYnNb": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Proper care helps preserve the beauty of gemstone jewelry.</p><ul><li>Clean with mild soap and a soft cloth<br/></li><li>Avoid harsh chemicals and ultrasonic cleaners (for softer stones)<br/></li><li>Store separately to prevent scratches<br/></li><li>Schedule periodic professional checks</li></ul>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        }
      },
